This directory is the header-only FAST-LIO core. It is intentionally NOT a
colcon package: the fastlio2_ros2 wrapper compiles the needed core sources
(ikd_Tree.cpp, preprocess.cpp) directly via the ../../fast_lio_core relative
path in its CMakeLists.txt. This COLCON_IGNORE keeps `colcon build` focused on
the two ROS 2 packages (livox_interfaces, fastlio2_ros2).
